     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-X1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
